Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.65,0:00:03.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.65,0:00:05.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,新的一集马上就要开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.79,0:00:07.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了找齐四魂之玉碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.99,0:00:09.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了用这把铁碎牙打败奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.16,0:00:13.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落惊人的妖气朝着丑寅方向消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.53,0:00:15.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次出现了既非人类
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.53,0:00:17.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也非妖怪的一个亡魂
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.63,0:00:19.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在新的战斗马上要开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.03,0:00:21.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师 珊瑚 七宝跟云母
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.80,0:00:23.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,穿梭于时空 发生在战国时代与现代
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.14,0:00:24.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.17,0:00:32.24,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,分散在蓝蓝天空上的 七颗星星{\fad(300,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.81,0:00:36.77,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每一颗星星 都刻着我的思念
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.02,0:00:40.71,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算梦想被粉碎 我也要寻找爱{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.96,0:00:44.76,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我无处可逃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.03,0:00:48.59,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,紧紧抓着我的梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.96,0:00:57.23,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些骗人的光阴 我再也不会输给它{\fad(0,600)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.34,0:01:02.50,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,睁大眼睛 看清楚这瞬间
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.81,0:01:06.77,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它仍然紧紧围绕着我们呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.05,0:01:10.78,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让人啜泣的 现实生活中
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.85,0:01:14.79,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最重要的…到底是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.56,0:01:18.49,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,繁忙的这个世界{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.76,0:01:22.75,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永恒的碎片 忽隐又忽现
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.03,0:01:26.80,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去触摸 去捕捉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.00,0:01:33.30,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就要循着目标继续向前走{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.94,0:01:38.84,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了得到最后的笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.01,0:01:45.85,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就要循着目标继续向前走{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.94,0:02:42.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第102话 被亡魂袭击的妖狼族
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.28,0:02:47.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丑寅方向…应该是往这边吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.89,0:02:56.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一股巨大不祥的妖气
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.96,0:02:58.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朝着丑寅方向飞走了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.49,0:03:01.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子这股妖气
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.13,0:03:04.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,指的应该就是奈落没错 不过…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.90,0:03:06.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.63,0:03:09.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落这个坏蛋到底跑到哪里去了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.14,0:03:12.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会不会因为结界被犬夜叉给破了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.47,0:03:14.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以只好躲起来了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.64,0:03:15.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落这么凶恶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.01,0:03:17.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该不会就这样躲起来了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.31,0:03:18.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.45,0:03:20.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道什么 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.32,0:03:22.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道奈落已经发现
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.65,0:03:24.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们追踪到妖气在哪里消失
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.65,0:03:27.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以故意布下陷阱好引我们上钩
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.99,0:03:29.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.29,0:03:32.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一路上碰的陷阱够多了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.43,0:03:34.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,照这么看来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.56,0:03:36.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是更接近奈落的巢穴
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.70,0:03:38.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定又有陷阱等着我们
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.44,0:03:42.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.17,0:03:45.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落到底又布下了什么样的陷阱呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.25,0:03:57.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖怪全都逃跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.97,0:04:14.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然 是这股臭味
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.57,0:04:16.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,长老
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.40,0:04:18.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们在山谷里的窝都被歼灭了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.64,0:04:20.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沼泽里的洞穴也被毁了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.04,0:04:24.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,厉鬼接二连三吃了他们兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.65,0:04:27.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,山上那些妖怪有一半都被吃掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.42,0:04:30.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,利爪跟尖牙全都打不过他们
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.98,0:04:32.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要对抗这帮侵略者
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.59,0:04:34.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看非得借助四魂之玉碎片才行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.56,0:04:40.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爷爷 那些坏蛋又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.56,0:04:43.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,山对面那些家伙都被吃光了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.36,0:04:45.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在逐渐逼近我们的势力范围了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.07,0:04:47.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也有同伴被吃掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.87,0:04:49.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看除了找钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.17,0:04:50.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都不是他的对手
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.00,0:04:51.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.07,0:04:53.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上次菖蒲想尽办法去求他
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.31,0:04:55.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁知道他坚持不肯回来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.88,0:05:03.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,厉鬼来了 快跑
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.62,0:05:05.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会被吃掉的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.09,0:05:10.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爷爷 我们分头应付
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.53,0:05:19.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这帮妖怪为什么突然…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.27,0:05:21.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们的食物被厉鬼抢走
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.77,0:05:22.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都饿坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.27,0:05:23.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.10,0:05:25.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道被厉鬼吃掉之前
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.77,0:05:27.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还得先喂饱这帮妖怪吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.14,0:05:31.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.42,0:05:39.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家快先过河再说
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.06,0:05:46.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真没想到厉鬼这么快就下山来了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.81,0:06:03.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说有一股强大妖气飞过
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.18,0:06:05.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从附近打听到的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.31,0:06:06.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝对错不了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.75,0:06:08.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是听说又消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.15,0:06:09.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.65,0:06:11.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朝哪边飞走了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.59,0:06:12.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这点大家好像也不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.19,0:06:16.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,顺着这条河流一直走
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.26,0:06:18.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上游就是北方的山
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.69,0:06:22.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,终于来到菖蒲跟长老爷爷家附近了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.03,0:06:24.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上次菖蒲那个丫头说过
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.33,0:06:27.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么厉鬼来 大家有危险了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.10,0:06:29.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拼了命想拉我跟她回去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.54,0:06:32.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结果却被我给赶走了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.34,0:06:36.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,突然有一种很不好的预感
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.49,0:06:47.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有血
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.23,0:06:55.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,长老
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.36,0:06:56.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爷爷
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.50,0:07:01.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不…不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.07,0:07:03.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只不过有点累了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.74,0:07:08.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爷爷 你振作一点啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.25,0:07:12.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些家伙已经追过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.71,0:07:16.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样吧 我来做饵引开那帮妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.58,0:07:18.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们就趁这个机会快点逃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.09,0:07:20.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,万一真追过来 老爷爷不就…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.22,0:07:24.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要保护长老尽快找到钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.73,0:07:25.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要他回来打败亡魂
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.89,0:07:28.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不要担心了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.23,0:07:31.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,区区几个杂碎小妖怪我还不放在眼里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.10,0:07:32.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老爷爷
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.17,0:07:37.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老爷爷 不行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.90,0:07:39.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快回来呀
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.54,0:07:40.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老爷爷
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.98,0:07:42.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.68,0:07:45.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你身上还有伤的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.28,0:07:46.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走吧 菖蒲
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.48,0:07:49.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别再婆婆妈妈说这些了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.62,0:07:51.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要辜负老爷爷的一番心意
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.00,0:08:09.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.01,0:08:13.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙少主
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.01,0:08:18.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.65,0:08:20.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来你们也是妖狼族
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.51,0:08:22.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老爷爷 原来你会说话
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.15,0:08:24.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你救了我一命
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.02,0:08:26.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过我恐怕不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.65,0:08:28.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老爷爷
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.52,0:08:30.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是北方山上的长老吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.99,0:08:31.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前一阵子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.79,0:08:34.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,菖蒲特别下山来找钢牙少主回去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.76,0:08:35.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.66,0:08:36.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙也来了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.90,0:08:38.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.80,0:08:42.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见到你真的是太好了 钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.54,0:08:45.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次我们大家放弃了家园
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.91,0:08:47.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从北方山上逃到这来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.68,0:08:50.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些妖怪也是一样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.18,0:08:52.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,逃到这来…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.78,0:08:53.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们在躲避什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.05,0:08:55.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是个亡魂
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.65,0:08:56.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亡魂
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.92,0:08:58.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个亡魂是从我们势力范围之外
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.69,0:09:01.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更北的地方来的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.82,0:09:05.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既不是妖怪 也不是人类
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.19,0:09:10.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身上发出一股尸体和坟土的臭味
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.93,0:09:12.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后来这个家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.83,0:09:16.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就开始吃…附近的妖怪了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.45,0:09:30.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这下怎么办 钢牙少主
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.22,0:09:31.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要去
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.95,0:09:33.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你该不会想去找那个亡魂吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.35,0:09:36.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不是正在找奈落吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.86,0:09:38.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这跟我们有什么关系吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.23,0:09:42.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以才更要去查个清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.36,0:09:43.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么多兄弟被杀
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.73,0:09:44.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能够坐视不理吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.60,0:09:46.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再加上
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.70,0:09:48.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那只臭笨狗也朝这边来了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.70,0:09:49.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.10,0:09:51.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这股狗骚味
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.37,0:09:52.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,错不了的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.11,0:09:55.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可受不了被他抢在前面
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.74,0:09:56.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.61,0:09:58.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等我 少主
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.12,0:10:04.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好大一股狼骚味
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.12,0:10:05.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狼？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.39,0:10:08.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这股特别自以为是的臭味
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.39,0:10:10.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙那小子 八成刚刚走过这里
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.76,0:10:12.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说来 钢牙也跟我们一样
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.13,0:10:15.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正朝着丑寅方向前进是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.90,0:10:17.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道他是不是掌握到其他线索呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.40,0:10:20.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们刚刚说了钢牙对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.90,0:10:21.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个声音是…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.01,0:10:31.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.51,0:10:34.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是菖蒲耶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.15,0:10:36.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,菖蒲姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.52,0:10:37.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的耶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.65,0:10:39.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她不就是那个把戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.89,0:10:41.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当成情敌的妖狼族姑娘吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.29,0:10:42.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.89,0:10:44.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.29,0:10:46.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是回北方山上去了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.79,0:10:49.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是回去了 不过
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.53,0:10:50.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.66,0:10:52.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有厉鬼追我们的族人所以又逃出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.17,0:10:53.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,厉鬼？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.30,0:10:55.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一只专门吃鬼的厉鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.80,0:10:59.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一只专门吃鬼的厉鬼？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.18,0:11:08.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,师…师父
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.55,0:11:10.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果今天不能够翻过这座山
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.05,0:11:11.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就得在野外过夜
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.55,0:11:13.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不如折回村子里
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.69,0:11:16.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求那些村民留我们过一夜吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.19,0:11:18.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么这么胆小
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.83,0:11:19.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,继续走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.80,0:11:22.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我听人说
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.83,0:11:26.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最近这一带经常有厉鬼出来害人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.97,0:11:27.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是真的碰到厉鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.47,0:11:31.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到时候用我的法力打鬼给你看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.24,0:12:05.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然是鬼在吃鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.88,0:12:11.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,师父 你快收拾他吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.48,0:12:16.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,办不到
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.38,0:12:18.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,师…师父
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.62,0:12:24.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亡魂
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.76,0:12:25.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.76,0:12:27.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那玩意既不是妖怪也不是人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.50,0:12:31.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个怪物是从东北方下来的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.90,0:12:32.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,东北方？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.53,0:12:35.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不就是丑寅方向了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.90,0:12:36.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没多久的时间
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.00,0:12:39.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住在山里的妖怪、精灵跟鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.57,0:12:40.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都被吃光了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.77,0:12:43.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最近甚至逼近我们的势力范围
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.64,0:12:46.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一大批兄弟都被吃掉了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.55,0:12:50.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们妖狼族应该没有这么不堪一击吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.05,0:12:53.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就像一座小山那么大
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.29,0:12:54.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然会有这种鬼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.66,0:12:58.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我听说自古以来有一些含恨而终的亡魂
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.29,0:12:59.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了替自己报仇
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.69,0:13:02.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,往往会化身成为厉鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.16,0:13:05.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是居然把妖怪全部都吃光
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.57,0:13:07.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底是什么力量
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.17,0:13:09.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才能够唤醒这种厉鬼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.94,0:13:11.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除了他还会有谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.94,0:13:12.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.81,0:13:15.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我必须带着长老爷爷
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.68,0:13:18.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有仅存的妖狼族兄弟逃亡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.95,0:13:19.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.31,0:13:20.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.58,0:13:23.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果碰见钢牙我一定帮你转告他
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.58,0:13:26.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖狼族兄弟 四处逃窜的这件事情
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.55,0:13:27.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你尽管放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.09,0:13:30.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.69,0:13:33.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自己小心一点喔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.46,0:13:35.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多保重啊 菖蒲
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.46,0:13:36.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听清楚了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.46,0:13:40.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个亡魂会发出尸体跟坟土的臭味喔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.47,0:13:48.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凶骨大爷
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.61,0:13:52.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拥有四魂之玉碎片的那个人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.71,0:13:54.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上就要到了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.22,0:13:57.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.35,0:14:02.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子比他那些狼兄弟来得更是时候
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.72,0:14:05.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你叫什么来着…琥珀吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.73,0:14:07.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以走了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.73,0:14:09.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过 虽然这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.36,0:14:14.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是先留下你背上那块四魂之玉碎片再走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.51,0:14:21.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,劝你不要随便乱来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.75,0:14:27.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来你们也在一边虎视眈眈哪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.75,0:14:29.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.38,0:14:32.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正我也不想这么快就死了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.39,0:14:35.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,费了那么大力气好不容易才复活呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.27,0:14:55.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不准你对我这班狼兄弟出手
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.18,0:14:58.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.28,0:15:01.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身上也有四魂之玉碎片的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.85,0:15:04.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好庞大…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.05,0:15:09.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,碎片我是要定了 还有你那条命
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.19,0:15:12.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好大的一个怪物喔
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.06,0:15:15.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是那个什么亡魂吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.56,0:15:18.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狼群的老爷爷说的没错
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.30,0:15:20.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你身上还真臭
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.93,0:15:23.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你既不是人也不是妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.57,0:15:25.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有一股尸体跟坟土的臭味
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.21,0:15:28.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我身上还有臭味啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.94,0:15:32.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从坟冢里出来已经好一段日子了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.31,0:15:33.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看吧 他没有否认
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.18,0:15:35.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道真的是亡魂
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.68,0:15:36.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子我得再多吃一点
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.68,0:15:38.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,增加身上的血肉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.09,0:15:40.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看你生得人高马大
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.22,0:15:43.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快来成为我凶骨大爷的血肉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.73,0:15:48.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 你这只怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.07,0:15:56.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你别想再吃我狼族兄弟的血肉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.61,0:16:00.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.57,0:16:02.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在脚上吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.24,0:16:04.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来你两只脚上
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.11,0:16:06.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都带有四魂之玉碎片呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.08,0:16:09.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你叫什么凶骨是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.75,0:16:11.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底是什么怪物啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.62,0:16:15.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这怪物身上闻不到奈落的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.86,0:16:17.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可见他并不是奈落的分身
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.62,0:16:18.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这点可以确定
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.76,0:16:22.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是什么怪物？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.86,0:16:25.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用问也知道我是个人类啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.00,0:16:28.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是 不是 绝对不可能的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.00,0:16:31.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你只是人类的话
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.77,0:16:34.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有可能死后还从坟墓里复活吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.04,0:16:38.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这都要归功于这个四魂之玉碎片呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.25,0:16:42.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是它让我的状况比活着的时候更好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.42,0:16:45.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉碎片！居然是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.59,0:16:48.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭家伙 你从什么地方弄到这个东西的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.56,0:16:50.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我为什么要告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.59,0:16:53.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不过是我嘴边的一块肉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.84,0:17:02.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就凭你这种慢吞吞的动作
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.34,0:17:05.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真以为可以抓到我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.24,0:17:09.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,动作快的家伙是在这呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.75,0:17:22.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底想打哪里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.02,0:17:26.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托你瞄准一点行不行
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.06,0:17:30.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打不中吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.34,0:17:36.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙少主
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.47,0:17:40.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个可恶的亡魂
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.04,0:17:42.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我倒要看看你还能够威风多久
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.32,0:17:55.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要每次都用同一招行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.87,0:18:10.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上给我滚回坟墓里去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.61,0:18:18.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇快看 那道光
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.91,0:18:20.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.55,0:18:23.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是 为什么会发出这么强的光芒呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.38,0:18:25.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道奈落跟钢牙碰上了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.02,0:18:28.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是这并不是奈落的气息啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.62,0:18:30.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个是…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.39,0:18:32.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是四魂之玉的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.79,0:18:33.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.36,0:18:35.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道是…钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.30,0:18:43.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙少主
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.87,0:18:47.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底想要打哪里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.84,0:18:49.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.88,0:18:58.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.72,0:18:59.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好厉害喔
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.39,0:19:04.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去死吧 杂碎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.60,0:19:21.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真以为三两下就能把我摆平了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.91,0:19:28.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,混帐家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.08,0:19:29.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.95,0:19:32.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙 看前面
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.66,0:19:38.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙少主
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.93,0:19:47.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.93,0:19:50.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些四魂之玉碎片就送给我吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.94,0:19:52.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不要做梦了 混帐
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.71,0:19:57.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根本就不痛不痒
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.41,0:20:00.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的目标本来就不是你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.69,0:20:09.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…我的四魂之玉碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.70,0:20:25.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.74,0:20:26.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙少主 你在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.31,0:20:28.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还活着吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.75,0:20:34.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.25,0:20:39.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是…奈落的毒虫
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.25,0:20:44.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,控制凶骨的原来是奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.20,0:20:50.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只剩一堆白骨了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.76,0:20:52.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是因为身体里被埋入四魂之玉碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.77,0:20:53.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以才能复活
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.17,0:20:56.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.74,0:20:58.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你帮兄弟们报了仇
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.21,0:21:01.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些不幸遇难的兄弟 这下可以瞑目了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.34,0:21:05.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落的邪气 朝着丑寅方向去了…吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.35,0:21:08.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 戈薇是这么说的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.35,0:21:09.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.28,0:21:12.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我走了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.29,0:21:14.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自己小心一点喔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.26,0:21:18.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇也跟我说过同样的话
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.06,0:21:26.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟戈薇一样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.70,0:21:31.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说凶骨已经死啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.60,0:21:33.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是 蛇骨大爷
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.51,0:21:36.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 那个没用的笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.51,0:21:38.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了 这也是没办法的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.98,0:21:42.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙本来就是我们之中最差劲的一个
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.32,0:21:45.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 怎么样呢 琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.29,0:21:46.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.55,0:21:51.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是啊 这次我的对手犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.79,0:21:54.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底是不是个帅哥呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.33,0:21:57.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这点恐怕要请您自己去判断
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.33,0:22:02.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真想早点会会你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.74,0:22:04.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.64,0:22:15.05,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}红红的太阳照亮一切{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.58,0:22:24.89,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也照遍过去和现在
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.09,0:22:34.26,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那些夕阳下的想象
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.54,0:22:44.07,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这颗心真的能承担吗{\fad(0,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.84,0:22:49.04,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉我什么办法才能
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.35,0:22:53.81,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}过得比以前更开朗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.12,0:23:01.36,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这么做就算会让自己委屈{\fad(0,500)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.36,0:23:07.59,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}默默承受伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.90,0:23:12.13,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}会失去一切
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.64,0:23:19.57,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真正的歌仍会不断在我心中回荡{\fad(0,500)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.08,0:23:29.28,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真正的歌才是我的路标{\fad(0,500)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.91,0:23:52.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一群手段凶残 最后死于非命的佣兵
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.58,0:23:54.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来到七人帮坟冢附近后
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.38,0:23:57.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我们眼前突然出现了一个耍弯刀的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.89,0:23:58.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.62,0:24:00.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是七人帮屠杀队长
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.42,0:24:02.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蛇骨大爷的蛇骨刀
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.89,0:24:04.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明往下劈了却还会来回旋绕的那把刀
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.93,0:24:05.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,简直就像是蛇
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.93,0:24:06.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.86,0:24:08.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底刀从哪边飞出来的都看不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.63,0:24:10.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.90,0:24:12.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七人帮重返人间
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.94,0:24:13.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.94,0:24:16.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你那对可爱的耳朵 送给我嘛
